@startuml
Entry901 --> note : predeclared bare keyword code
Entry901 --> note2 : predeclared numbered code
state Shell901 {
  note: bare note word is a state field here
  note2 : numbered note prefix is also a state field
  [*] --> note
  note --> note2
  note2 --> [*]
}
note2 --> Exit901 : leaves nested state
state Entry901
state Exit901
@enduml
